All other files in this directory are not part of Savane.

* mirror-redirect is exempt from Savane because of technical reasons:
  the protocol it uses has no reasonable option to prominently offer
  the interacting user its source code, so it's released under the GPL
   rather than the AGPL.

* cities15000 and its source file cities15000.txt come from GeoNames
  and are distributed under the CC BY-4.0; it's used as the input
  for the script preparing mirror lists, so there is no reason
  to apply other additional licenses to it, that would only add
  unneeded complexity. cities15000.txt is effectively taken from GeoNames,
  cities15000 is generated from it.

* CC0 and CC_BY-4.0 are copies of Creative Commons licenses.
  CC_BY-4.0 is the license for GeoNames data, CC0 is the license
  for CC_BY-4.0 and CC0 itself.
